QRFI - Tax Info
What this is
A standalone VB.NET WinForms desktop application ("QRFI - TAX INFO") that generates
and distributes tax information documents for clients' retirement savings and other
accounts. It is a batch tool run manually by an operator, not a web application, and
is unrelated to the IMMO_Sample MVC codebase.
Tech stack
VB.NET WinForms (.NET Framework)
Microsoft.Reporting.WinForms (LocalReport) for RDLC report rendering
iTextSharp for post-render PDF manipulation (merge, split, page numbering)
Oracle (Oracle.ManagedDataAccess.Client) via raw SQL + DataAdapter/DataSet,
not stored procedures with JSON output
SmtpClient for email delivery
Entry point and main workflow
frmMain.vb is the application's core. On load it:
Checks QRFI.TAX_ACCESS_MGT for the current Windows user; closes the app if no
access row exists. Shows the Access Rights button only for ST_LEVEL = 9 users.
Calls checkNumberOfAccountsAbove600() — if the prior batch day processed more
than 600 accounts, disables Generate/Email and warns the user (data may be
incorrect above this threshold; historically needs manual intervention from the
LAD team).
Otherwise counts pending dossiers (explicitly requested via
QRFI.TAX_RESEND_DOSS, or unsent and older than LOAD_DELAY days) and shows the
count in the status label.
Three sequential buttons drive the batch:
